# The AM-side dayparts (Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale sv --
# morgon [05:00, 10:00), formiddag [10:00, 12:00)) doubling as the MERIDIEM
# slot of "atta pa morgonen"/"tio pa formiddagen" -- the same daypart-as-
# meridiem reuse es/pt already make for "de la manana"/"da manha" (see their
# clock_meridiem_am.voc).  Surfaces copied verbatim from daypart_morgon_sv.voc
# and daypart_formiddag_sv.voc.
morgon
morgonen
förmiddag
formiddag
förmiddagen
formiddagen
